IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BUBBLE-SORT-DEMO.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TABLE.
   05 WS-ITEM PIC 9(3) OCCURS 8 TIMES.
01 WS-SIZE    PIC 9(2) VALUE 8.
01 WS-I       PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
01 WS-J       PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
01 WS-TEMP    PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-SWAPPED PIC 9(1) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 64 TO WS-ITEM(1).
    MOVE 25 TO WS-ITEM(2).
    MOVE 12 TO WS-ITEM(3).
    MOVE 22 TO WS-ITEM(4).
    MOVE 11 TO WS-ITEM(5).
    MOVE 90 TO WS-ITEM(6).
    MOVE 33 TO WS-ITEM(7).
    MOVE 7  TO WS-ITEM(8).
    DISPLAY "Before sort:".
    PERFORM DISPLAY-TABLE.
    MOVE 1 TO WS-SWAPPED.
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-SWAPPED = 0
        MOVE 0 TO WS-SWAPPED
        PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1
            UNTIL WS-I > 7
            COMPUTE WS-J = WS-I + 1
            IF WS-ITEM(WS-I) > WS-ITEM(WS-J)
                MOVE WS-ITEM(WS-I) TO WS-TEMP
                COMPUTE WS-ITEM(WS-I) = WS-ITEM(WS-J)
                COMPUTE WS-ITEM(WS-J) = WS-TEMP
                MOVE 1 TO WS-SWAPPED
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM.
    DISPLAY "After sort:".
    PERFORM DISPLAY-TABLE.
    STOP RUN.
DISPLAY-TABLE.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-SIZE
        DISPLAY WS-ITEM(WS-I)
    END-PERFORM.
